  'ctx.lockupBill': 'The lockup bill arrives with the arithmetic torn away: {b} credits to open the door, {a} credits a cycle, and a total at the foot of it.',
  'ask.costOfStorage': 'What does storage for {c} cycles come to?',
  'ask.howManyCyclesStorage': 'How many cycles of storage does {c} credits buy?',
